text: ['Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Dragon spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', "Flying\\nWhen Foe-Razer Regent enters the battlefield, you may have it fight target creature you don't control.\\nWhenever a creature you control fights, put two +1/+1 counters on it at the beginning of the next end step.", '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.']
flavor: ['Atarka goblins meet their demise as readily as their Temur counterparts did, but usually under big, winged shadows.', 'Atarka serving-goblins coat themselves with grease imbued with noxious herbs, hoping to discourage their ravenous masters from adding them to the meal.', 'The land is ever resilient. Should it die, it will be reborn.']
